        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Parafield, South Australia; Adelaide city centre\n- Organizations: Parafield Airport; University of South Australia\n- Transport infrastructure: Parafield railway station\n\nFacts:\n- Parafield, South Australia, is essentially contiguous with Parafield Airport.\n- Parafield Airport has the ICAO code YPPF.\n- Parafield Airport is on the edge of the residential suburb of Parafield, South Australia, 18 km north of the Adelaide city centre.\n- Parafield Airport is adjacent to the Mawson Lakes campus of the University of South Australia.\n- Parafield railway station is situated in the northern Adelaide suburb of Parafield.\n- Parafield railway station is 17.7 km from Adelaide station.",
